From: Aurelia contributors
Subject: Preserve hardening, assertions and warning-free compilation on the current SDK

Respect SDK _FORTIFY_SOURCE in released configure probes and config.h. Modernize the
legacy Autoconf K&R probe for Clang22. Use proper GNU make pattern-rule prerequisites;
read the bundled revision for release tarballs without attempting a nonexistent Git repo.
Mark the unused SDP parameter in the disabled stream-output stub. Preserve unconditional
upstream development TODO reminders as comments; input-clock and native-window behavior
remain those of the pinned release. Aurelia uses its own Avalonia frame-callback window.

